      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "These guys were fantastic. They organized an time to come out and see the place very quickly (within a day) and came prepared with some options but listened to what we were after before they presented any of them. They were totally flexible with the design and components as they were not tied to any specific brand. Installation was organized quickly as well and everything looks neat and professional. They were open about the advantages and issues of going with some of the cheaper components and helped us navigate the minefield of options. The system we ended up with was agreed by several other installers to be about the best 'budget' system you could get (still all with at least 10 years warranty)",
